'''beans'''
#Plural of [[bean]].
Commonly included in a childhood song - beans beans they're good for your heart, the more you eat, the more you fart, the more you eat, the better you feel so let's have beans for every meal!

Definition: A type of vegetable that can come in many varieties, but commonly the baked bean - haricot bean. This commonly grows in england and is eaten in a tomato sauce and served as a side order, not the base of the meal - Knowledge Guru